window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>When I see her, I have to have her.</b></p> <p>The one they call Shelby.</p> <p>But the humans have not given her to us. She remains behind the walls of the facility they have reclaimed. She remains with a male that does not <i>deserve</i> her.</p> <p>This beautiful, enchanting creature with long black braids and bright eyes needs a real male, a master, a true protector. She needs <i>me</i>.</p> <p>I will do whatever it takes to claim her.</p> <p>I’ll kill.</p> <p>I’ll lie.</p> <p>I’ll steal.</p> <p>No human, naga, or otherwise will keep us apart. Tonight, Shelby will be in <i>my</i> arms.</p> <p>To hell with the rest.</p>"; 
